  117-wifi-ath12k-avoid-buffer-overread-in-ath12k_wmi_op_rx.patch
  118-wifi-ath12k-fix-overreads-in-CSA-switch-count-event.patch
  119-wifi-ath12k-validate-TLV-length-in-process_tpc_stats.patch

